OL,3,GNEWSAMajor M6 delays as lorry sheds
OL,4,Aglass load in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M6 in Staffordshire
OL,7,Fhad to be shut during rush hour after a
OL,8,Fcrash involving a car and a lorry that
OL,9,Fshed its load of glass across the road.
OL,11,FThe lorry also struck a bridge just
OL,12,Fbefore 08:30 GMT, between junction 14
OL,13,Ffor Stafford and junction 15 for
OL,14,FStoke-on-Trent, with drivers warned
OL,15,Fthey faced delays of more than 90
OL,16,Fminutes.
OL,18,FPolice and fire crews shut the motorway
OL,19,Fin both directions with medics,
OL,20,Fincluding the air ambulance, called to
OL,21,Fthe scene, National Highways (NH)
OL,22,Fconfirmed.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
