OL,3,GNEWSAMajor M6 delays as lorry sheds
OL,4,Aglass load in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men were treated for injuries not
OL,7,Fbelieved to be serious and were taken
OL,8,Fto Royal Stoke University Hospital,
OL,9,FWest Midlands Ambulance service said.
